'''Hawk's Vigil''' is a mountain [[Alliance]] town located in the southern hills of the [[Wetlands]], to the east of [[Dun Agrath]]. It was founded by humans of [[Lordaeron (kingdom)|Lordaeron]] that fled their fallen kingdom when it fell to the [[Scourge]],<ref>{{questlong|Alliance|22|Honoring the Departed}}</ref> and have been bracing themselves for a Scourge raid that never came.<ref>[https://web.archive.org/web/20260514170802/https://turtlecraft.gg/new-locations-and-maps New Zones & World Edits]. Archived from [https://turtlecraft.gg/new-locations-and-maps the original] on 2026-05-14. Retrieved on 2026-29-08.</ref>

